WEBVTT

00:00:09.020 --> 00:00:11.110
I’ll protect you.

00:00:21.620 --> 00:00:23.470
Princess!

00:00:41.520 --> 00:00:43.230
No…

00:00:43.230 --> 00:00:44.600
I’ll kill you.

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:50.730
I’ll kill you!

00:00:56.970 --> 00:00:58.650
What the hell?

00:00:58.650 --> 00:01:00.730
Did you have a nightmare?

00:01:00.730 --> 00:01:01.580
No.

00:01:01.580 --> 00:01:03.550
Wait, what are you doing here?!

00:01:03.550 --> 00:01:07.610
I have been busy recently and unable to talk to you much,

00:01:07.610 --> 00:01:10.290
so I went to the trouble of coming to see you.

00:01:10.290 --> 00:01:15.150
But alas… I arrived to find you in the depths of slumber,

00:01:15.150 --> 00:01:17.970
so then I took the time to gander at your face.

00:01:17.970 --> 00:01:20.680
Is looking at my sleeping face that much fun?

00:01:20.680 --> 00:01:22.300
Yes, it is.

00:01:23.300 --> 00:01:26.130
Your body has grown very much,

00:01:26.130 --> 00:01:30.520
but your sleeping face is no different from how it was when we first met.

00:01:32.280 --> 00:01:34.080
Hey, Princess.

00:01:34.080 --> 00:01:36.530
You know that flower in the greenhouse…

00:01:37.750 --> 00:01:38.910
Cleome.

00:01:38.910 --> 00:01:43.530
There is a beautiful flower garden at my secret place.

00:01:43.530 --> 00:01:47.040
That is where I got the flowers that are in the greenhouse.

00:01:47.410 --> 00:01:48.500
Cleome.

00:01:48.500 --> 00:01:50.420
Say, Akira.

00:01:50.420 --> 00:01:52.420
Are you free this weekend?

00:01:52.420 --> 00:01:53.090
Why?

00:01:54.040 --> 00:01:55.500
Well…

00:01:55.500 --> 00:01:58.790
Since the Bund situation is finally settling down,

00:01:58.790 --> 00:01:59.870
I thought…

00:01:59.870 --> 00:02:02.600
…that I may have a little free time.

00:02:04.140 --> 00:02:05.720
Will you come see the garden with me?

00:02:06.730 --> 00:02:07.980
That sounds…

00:02:07.980 --> 00:02:09.350
No, wait!

00:02:09.650 --> 00:02:12.160
Sorry. I have plans this weekend.

00:02:12.160 --> 00:02:13.090
What?!

00:02:13.090 --> 00:02:15.310
I-I’m definitely free next weekend.

00:02:15.310 --> 00:02:16.690
You can take me wherever you want.

00:02:17.350 --> 00:02:18.320
Definitely?

00:02:18.650 --> 00:02:19.990
Yeah.

00:02:25.330 --> 00:02:31.460
It was a certain afternoon, after that terrorism incident at the Bund had settled down,

00:02:31.460 --> 00:02:33.750
and everything seemed to be at peace.

00:02:34.770 --> 00:02:36.260
It isn’t anything grand, is it?

00:02:36.720 --> 00:02:40.470
But… is it all right for us to even be here?

00:02:41.020 --> 00:02:46.310
When you’re off duty, you’re free to accompany Her Highness as her friends,

00:02:46.310 --> 00:02:47.220
so of course it’s all right.

00:02:47.830 --> 00:02:52.200
President Shinonome began to live in the Bund with Yuzuru-kun,

00:02:52.200 --> 00:02:56.900
and by working close to Princess Mina as her maid, she has been permitted to return to school.

00:03:00.250 --> 00:03:01.660
Have you become accustomed yet, Yuzuru?

00:03:01.660 --> 00:03:02.840
Yes.

00:03:02.840 --> 00:03:06.840
I am truly grateful to Your Highness and Akira-san.

00:03:06.840 --> 00:03:09.330
Without you, Nee-chan and I wouldn’t have…

00:03:10.580 --> 00:03:12.620
You’re certainly lovey-dovey.

00:03:12.620 --> 00:03:13.710
It’s bad for my eyes.

00:03:14.160 --> 00:03:16.710
“Peace was finally upon us.”

00:03:17.210 --> 00:03:20.380
Back when such a thought crossed my mind…

00:03:20.380 --> 00:03:22.130
By the way, where’s Akira-kun?

00:03:23.140 --> 00:03:26.290
He had something to do and left.

00:03:26.290 --> 00:03:28.390
He even rejected my offer.

00:03:29.650 --> 00:03:33.440
But the next page of the story was colored with cruelty.

00:03:34.440 --> 00:03:37.190
Let’s forget about that boring man…

00:03:37.190 --> 00:03:39.330
…and have the utmost fun today!

00:03:39.330 --> 00:03:40.740
Yeah!

00:03:40.740 --> 00:03:44.950
The events that took place between that moment and the coming dawn,

00:03:44.950 --> 00:03:49.830
would engrave upon me, as well as Princess Mina and Akira-kun,

00:03:49.830 --> 00:03:53.540
a deeply profound and everlasting scar.

00:03:54.620 --> 00:03:55.460
You know…

00:03:57.840 --> 00:04:02.590
It’s just like you to actually come when I call you over, Akira-kun.

00:04:03.500 --> 00:04:08.010
The one who said, “You’d better show up after all that you owe me,” was you, wasn’t it?

00:04:09.960 --> 00:04:12.450
Oh, you actually felt obliged?

00:04:13.100 --> 00:04:14.340
Yeah.

00:04:14.340 --> 00:04:18.400
Besides, there’s a mountain-load of things I wanted to ask you.

00:04:18.400 --> 00:04:22.830
From the top, 83-58-85.

00:04:23.610 --> 00:04:24.610
What?

00:04:27.060 --> 00:04:28.660
Oh, and I’m also a virgin.

00:04:28.660 --> 00:04:29.500
Vir—

00:04:29.500 --> 00:04:30.620
You don’t believe me?

00:04:30.620 --> 00:04:32.530
I’m shocked.

00:04:33.130 --> 00:04:34.840
Then, do you want to see for yourself?

00:04:36.010 --> 00:04:37.340
S-Shut up!

00:04:37.340 --> 00:04:39.410
What are you saying in broad daylight?!

00:04:39.410 --> 00:04:40.420
Oh, then it’s fine at night?

00:04:40.740 --> 00:04:41.380
You pervert.

00:04:41.380 --> 00:04:43.050
Who is?!

00:04:45.940 --> 00:04:46.600
Tasty?

00:04:47.060 --> 00:04:48.300
You…

00:04:52.000 --> 00:04:53.230
Try and catch me!

00:04:53.730 --> 00:04:54.600
You little…

00:05:06.800 --> 00:05:08.360
It feels great.

00:05:08.360 --> 00:05:09.750
Why don’t you join me?

00:05:10.110 --> 00:05:11.290
You’re…

00:05:14.330 --> 00:05:16.930
I win this game of tag.

00:05:16.930 --> 00:05:18.120
Whatev—

00:05:19.910 --> 00:05:21.850
Meiren, you…

00:05:22.950 --> 00:05:23.590
Oh…

00:05:30.760 --> 00:05:32.100
Idiot.

00:05:32.100 --> 00:05:34.150
Why aren’t you wearing one?

00:05:34.150 --> 00:05:34.980
I can see through your clothes.

00:05:37.070 --> 00:05:38.190
I got tagged.

00:05:38.190 --> 00:05:40.480
Just shut up.

00:05:44.190 --> 00:05:47.820
Geez. Have you no shame?

00:05:49.200 --> 00:05:52.610
Why should I be yelled at when I gave you some service?

00:05:52.610 --> 00:05:56.460
Ah! Or is it because you didn’t want other guys to see?

00:05:59.090 --> 00:06:01.970
Haven’t you toyed with me enough already?

00:06:01.970 --> 00:06:04.000
Why don’t we get to the point already?

00:06:04.000 --> 00:06:07.500
It sounds like you’re used to being toyed with.

00:06:07.500 --> 00:06:09.320
Shut up, will you?

00:06:14.340 --> 00:06:15.140
This flower…

00:06:18.350 --> 00:06:20.860
You know about cleomes?

00:06:21.230 --> 00:06:24.320
The summer flowers that bloom at night.

00:06:24.710 --> 00:06:26.240
At night?

00:06:31.760 --> 00:06:35.390
These flowers have another name.

00:06:36.080 --> 00:06:37.540
Don’t they remind you of something?

00:06:43.920 --> 00:06:47.460
It’s as if butterflies are swarming to the flowers.

00:06:47.840 --> 00:06:48.630
Thus…

00:06:48.630 --> 00:06:49.680
“The Butterfly Plant.”

00:06:51.700 --> 00:06:53.970
These flowers have a sad legend to them.

00:06:56.970 --> 00:07:00.470
Once upon a time, there was a butterfly.

00:07:00.470 --> 00:07:05.990
One day, he found a beautiful butterfly and fell in love.

00:07:06.570 --> 00:07:09.320
But the butterfly he fell in love with…

00:07:09.960 --> 00:07:12.990
…always rested on the flower in absolute stillness.

00:07:13.700 --> 00:07:16.860
Despite that, he continued his courtship,

00:07:16.860 --> 00:07:20.680
wasting his life away day and night.

00:07:21.800 --> 00:07:25.830
Even when his life ended and he fell slowly to the ground…

00:07:25.830 --> 00:07:29.010
Even as his beautiful wings were carried by the wind…

00:07:29.370 --> 00:07:33.020
The one that resembled a butterfly, but was not one by any means…

00:07:33.020 --> 00:07:36.780
That flower… just stood there in the wind,

00:07:36.780 --> 00:07:39.600
and did nothing but sway gently.

00:07:39.890 --> 00:07:41.930
“The Butterfly Plant,” huh…

00:07:41.930 --> 00:07:42.850
It’s as if…

00:07:44.720 --> 00:07:46.210
Are you enjoying yourselves?

00:07:46.210 --> 00:07:46.740
Yeah.

00:07:47.150 --> 00:07:52.120
I know I’m asking for the impossible, but it’d be great to have the sun out.

00:07:52.120 --> 00:07:53.410
It is not impossible.

00:07:53.840 --> 00:07:58.990
This building is designed to allow for sunlight in any room you wish.

00:08:01.540 --> 00:08:03.620
Hey, that wasn’t funny!

00:08:03.620 --> 00:08:04.380
Hey, stop that!

00:08:15.010 --> 00:08:16.290
Wow…

00:08:16.290 --> 00:08:19.750
Do all vampires have such great style?

00:08:20.310 --> 00:08:22.520
Are you making fun of me?

00:08:22.520 --> 00:08:24.370
N-No, of course not!

00:08:24.370 --> 00:08:27.520
Besides, when you change forms, you—

00:08:27.860 --> 00:08:30.400
Did I not ask you to keep quiet about that?

00:08:33.690 --> 00:08:36.810
I won’t grow any bigger for a while.

00:08:36.810 --> 00:08:40.700
Even Akira, despite the fact he knows that I am much older,

00:08:40.700 --> 00:08:43.800
still treats me like a child from time to time.

00:08:43.800 --> 00:08:47.460
He is such an unsociable, oblivious man.

00:08:48.710 --> 00:08:50.840
But one day, won’t you also…

00:08:51.210 --> 00:08:52.510
Yes…

00:08:52.510 --> 00:08:55.340
I do dream of such a day.

00:08:55.340 --> 00:09:01.180
A dream in which I am as tall as him, and we’re deeply in love, having sex.

00:09:02.880 --> 00:09:05.710
Yet I have never hated my current body.

00:09:05.710 --> 00:09:08.560
But in fact, I am rather grateful for it.

00:09:08.560 --> 00:09:14.280
It is because I am in my current state, that Akira and I can be together like this.

00:09:14.280 --> 00:09:16.280
Princess…

00:09:18.410 --> 00:09:19.910
How can that be?!

00:09:19.910 --> 00:09:22.540
Your Highness, an emergency transmission from the Ministry of Public Security!

00:09:23.670 --> 00:09:28.500
The three ships, Aboukyu, Kremlin and Sanssouci, are approaching the Bund.

00:09:31.900 --> 00:09:33.410
I learned a lot today.

00:09:33.410 --> 00:09:34.760
You’re surprisingly knowledgeable.

00:09:47.630 --> 00:09:51.990
Well, the person whom I hold dearest loved those flowers.

00:09:53.260 --> 00:09:57.530
But seeing as how you didn’t say anything after seeing those flowers,

00:09:57.530 --> 00:10:01.120
your memories really haven’t been completely restored yet.

00:10:02.340 --> 00:10:08.420
One of the reasons I asked you out was to see how you were recovering.

00:10:08.420 --> 00:10:09.380
Why?

00:10:09.750 --> 00:10:10.630
I can’t tell you.

00:10:11.240 --> 00:10:15.880
But when you completely recover, blood will definitely rain.

00:10:16.890 --> 00:10:20.140
Meiren, who are you?

00:10:20.780 --> 00:10:22.140
I already told you.

00:10:22.140 --> 00:10:23.700
I don’t believe you!

00:10:23.700 --> 00:10:25.540
Well, that’s fine with me.

00:10:26.350 --> 00:10:30.900
But I can relate to you more than anyone else in the world could.

00:10:31.250 --> 00:10:34.710
More than any human could, and more than any vampire could.

00:10:34.710 --> 00:10:36.910
You and I can understand each other that much.

00:10:37.530 --> 00:10:38.700
You’re…

00:10:39.030 --> 00:10:43.790
You will soon be faced with the greatest trial of your life.

00:10:44.070 --> 00:10:47.370
And if possible, I’d like for you to survive.

00:10:50.020 --> 00:10:51.080
So…

00:10:54.500 --> 00:10:55.840
The Three Clans?

00:10:55.840 --> 00:10:57.210
Yes.

00:10:58.260 --> 00:11:03.220
They are the lineages that descended from true vampires.

00:11:03.560 --> 00:11:07.720
In the past, one hundred vampire clans ruled the land and bathed in glory,

00:11:07.720 --> 00:11:11.270
but all that remains are just three clans:

00:11:11.780 --> 00:11:14.740
Li, Ivanovic, and Rozenmann.

00:11:14.740 --> 00:11:16.860
They are vassals of my bloodline…

00:11:18.690 --> 00:11:21.200
…and also enemies.

00:11:21.530 --> 00:11:22.620
Enemies?

00:11:22.620 --> 00:11:26.830
It is like a family discord that has spanned across several hundred years.

00:11:26.830 --> 00:11:31.920
Our lives span an eternity, so the same applies to everything else.

00:11:33.090 --> 00:11:34.110
How do I look?

00:11:34.110 --> 00:11:36.220
This is my battle suit.

00:11:37.050 --> 00:11:38.470
Battle?

00:11:38.470 --> 00:11:39.460
Do not worry.

00:11:39.460 --> 00:11:43.420
They have no plans to personally harm me.

00:11:43.420 --> 00:11:45.390
There’s a reason they cannot.

00:11:45.390 --> 00:11:46.980
That is the relationship.

00:11:46.980 --> 00:11:48.520
They threaten knowing it.

00:11:48.520 --> 00:11:50.790
And I kept myself from them knowing it.

00:11:53.100 --> 00:11:56.570
A ruler is just another name for a buffoon.

00:11:58.470 --> 00:12:00.860
Then couldn’t you at least wait for Akira-kun?

00:12:01.160 --> 00:12:01.740
No.

00:12:02.450 --> 00:12:05.570
I will not allow him to come near this matter.

00:12:05.570 --> 00:12:06.770
Why?

00:12:06.770 --> 00:12:07.860
It’s times like these when—

00:12:07.860 --> 00:12:11.370
If he is by my side, he is bound to learn of it…

00:12:11.370 --> 00:12:13.580
Bound to learn my true form.

00:12:14.820 --> 00:12:15.760
Do not worry.

00:12:15.760 --> 00:12:17.250
I will not lose.

00:12:17.250 --> 00:12:18.280
No matter what.

00:12:20.550 --> 00:12:21.760
Princess…

00:12:27.600 --> 00:12:28.480
What?!

00:12:28.480 --> 00:12:31.650
The Princess told me not to tell you, but…

00:12:34.450 --> 00:12:36.680
Is this what you meant by “trial”?

00:12:36.680 --> 00:12:39.910
But you’re still going, aren’t you?

00:12:39.910 --> 00:12:40.610
Yeah.

00:12:40.980 --> 00:12:44.760
Hey, why are you so devoted?

00:12:44.760 --> 00:12:46.630
Because I made a promise.

00:12:46.630 --> 00:12:47.540
Is that all?

00:12:47.940 --> 00:12:48.780
No.

00:12:49.940 --> 00:12:50.830
I see.

00:12:52.540 --> 00:12:53.540
Don’t forget.

00:12:54.110 --> 00:12:55.790
No matter how strongly the butterfly wishes,

00:12:56.260 --> 00:12:59.090
he will never be together with the flower.

00:13:05.970 --> 00:13:09.560
Welcome, The Three Clans, to my new home.

00:13:11.560 --> 00:13:14.730
Do forgive us for our unannounced visit.

00:13:15.480 --> 00:13:20.110
We were eagerly awaiting our invitation for the opening ceremony,

00:13:21.170 --> 00:13:23.920
but our patience reached its limits.

00:13:23.920 --> 00:13:26.570
My humblest apologies.

00:13:26.570 --> 00:13:30.290
I have had my hands full with one problem after another.

00:13:30.290 --> 00:13:31.660
Telomere?

00:13:32.020 --> 00:13:36.680
While you three have been having a staring contest,

00:13:36.680 --> 00:13:38.750
the world has begun to change.

00:13:40.110 --> 00:13:43.880
What absurdity to use those pests as your excuse.

00:13:44.490 --> 00:13:46.060
Your Majesty,

00:13:46.060 --> 00:13:50.600
the fact remains that you acted independently without consulting your guardians.

00:13:51.800 --> 00:13:56.270
Do I need your approval to even lift my finger?

00:13:56.580 --> 00:13:58.810
We may share ancestors, but we are clearly different.

00:13:59.100 --> 00:14:01.440
I require no excessive interference.

00:14:01.440 --> 00:14:03.650
Know your place, little girl!

00:14:03.650 --> 00:14:06.560
You may be a direct descendant of the true vampire,

00:14:06.560 --> 00:14:08.410
but the Royal Family has already lost its authority.

00:14:08.410 --> 00:14:10.150
In this day and age,

00:14:10.150 --> 00:14:13.460
you cannot be the Queen of the Vampires without us.

00:14:14.200 --> 00:14:16.630
It was you who robbed me of my authority.

00:14:16.930 --> 00:14:18.690
Then allow me to ask.

00:14:18.690 --> 00:14:21.380
How is it that this Țepeș Castle was built?

00:14:21.380 --> 00:14:25.010
And how is it that I am currently residing in it?

00:14:25.880 --> 00:14:31.670
Indeed, you have bounded me and have stood in my way.

00:14:31.670 --> 00:14:34.270
Despite that, the castle was built.

00:14:34.270 --> 00:14:35.770
Do you understand?

00:14:35.770 --> 00:14:38.750
And I am here at this very moment.

00:14:38.750 --> 00:14:42.020
This is proof that I am the Queen of the Vampires.

00:14:42.020 --> 00:14:45.650
Not one being can control me.

00:14:49.330 --> 00:14:51.830
You have become quite stubborn.

00:14:52.700 --> 00:14:58.750
Indeed, none of us here may be able to control you,

00:14:59.090 --> 00:15:03.850
but even you cannot go against the rules of our species.

00:15:03.850 --> 00:15:05.210
Have you forgotten?

00:15:06.840 --> 00:15:08.840
We are your fiancés.

00:15:09.890 --> 00:15:11.530
What do you mean?

00:15:11.530 --> 00:15:13.260
It’s Her Royal Highness’ order.

00:15:13.670 --> 00:15:16.220
We cannot allow the entry of Kaburagi Akira.

00:15:16.220 --> 00:15:16.890
Geez.

00:15:17.640 --> 00:15:18.770
She’s so stubborn.

00:15:19.130 --> 00:15:20.650
I guess I’ll have to call some—

00:15:33.990 --> 00:15:35.260
Vera-san.

00:15:35.260 --> 00:15:36.580
What did he mean?

00:15:36.990 --> 00:15:41.080
It is the duty of the Queen of the Vampires, the head of the Royal Family.

00:15:41.380 --> 00:15:43.710
I hope you haven’t forgotten.

00:15:44.670 --> 00:15:47.810
In preservation of the pure blood,

00:15:47.810 --> 00:15:52.010
choose one of the pure ruling families as a partner and bear a child.

00:15:53.290 --> 00:15:58.850
The four of us here are the only vampires who are descended from the ancient true blood.

00:15:58.850 --> 00:16:04.520
And the only one who can give birth is you, Princess Mina.

00:16:05.450 --> 00:16:08.950
You must wed with one of us and bear a child.

00:16:08.950 --> 00:16:13.490
That is our duty as the heads of the species, and our fate.

00:16:14.990 --> 00:16:17.540
I fully understand that.

00:16:17.540 --> 00:16:23.630
If this body that has yet gone through puberty could ever give birth,

00:16:23.630 --> 00:16:28.130
then I will gladly wed one of you three.

00:16:28.130 --> 00:16:30.510
Which you have continuously told us.

00:16:30.510 --> 00:16:35.510
For the longest time, we’ve waited, and we are still at a three-way deadlock.

00:16:35.970 --> 00:16:39.470
But we’ve begun to grow tired of this situation.

00:16:39.470 --> 00:16:42.770
So we decided to go through with a bet.

00:16:42.770 --> 00:16:44.150
A bet?

00:16:46.560 --> 00:16:51.660
I hear that you keep a child by your side,

00:16:51.660 --> 00:16:55.200
and that you adore him very much.

00:16:55.200 --> 00:16:57.450
What about Akira?

00:16:59.250 --> 00:17:02.040
The dog seems to be in Hall 4.

00:17:02.040 --> 00:17:02.960
Connect us to him.

00:17:02.960 --> 00:17:04.330
You are watching, aren’t you?

00:17:09.580 --> 00:17:11.630
Can you hear me, dog?

00:17:13.000 --> 00:17:19.670
The moment we disembarked our ships, we each sent an assassin to hunt you down.

00:17:28.600 --> 00:17:34.610
He is my strongest and most merciless assassin.

00:17:39.410 --> 00:17:42.610
He has never failed to kill his targets.

00:17:44.660 --> 00:17:45.550
This voice…

00:17:45.550 --> 00:17:46.750
Could it be The Three Clans?

00:17:50.670 --> 00:17:51.800
And their target is…

00:17:52.280 --> 00:17:53.300
You.

00:17:53.920 --> 00:17:56.180
The Princess’ cute little pet.

00:18:02.760 --> 00:18:05.650
The master of the assassin who kills him by dawn…

00:18:05.650 --> 00:18:09.230
…will be the Princess’ husband.

00:18:10.430 --> 00:18:14.490
Dog, you have been given an honorable task.

00:18:15.490 --> 00:18:16.570
Now die.

00:18:17.280 --> 00:18:18.320
Shit…

00:18:23.490 --> 00:18:25.960
Now, the dog hunt begins.

00:18:34.870 --> 00:18:35.860
Stop!

00:18:35.860 --> 00:18:37.590
Dismiss the assassins at once!

00:18:37.590 --> 00:18:39.610
He’s just a dog.

00:18:39.610 --> 00:18:41.300
You need not lose your composure.

00:18:41.300 --> 00:18:43.040
He isn’t just a dog.

00:18:43.040 --> 00:18:44.310
He’s my—

00:18:44.310 --> 00:18:47.310
Lover? I hope not.

00:18:55.320 --> 00:18:57.720
That is just a werewolf.

00:18:57.720 --> 00:19:03.480
His place, species, and even his life span are far too different from yours.

00:19:03.480 --> 00:19:07.540
Just like all other beings, he is on the other side.

00:19:09.540 --> 00:19:11.120
It is time you recognized that fact.

00:19:11.120 --> 00:19:14.170
We four are the only ones on this side.

00:19:14.420 --> 00:19:17.580
This world consists only of us.

00:19:17.580 --> 00:19:21.970
There is no other place for you to reside.

00:19:25.080 --> 00:19:26.170
Akira…

00:19:31.560 --> 00:19:32.570
Don’t forget.

00:19:33.820 --> 00:19:35.570
No matter how strongly the butterfly wishes,

00:19:36.570 --> 00:19:39.950
he will never be together with the flower.

00:19:40.350 --> 00:19:41.320
Don’t let them confuse you!

00:19:41.740 --> 00:19:43.450
Don’t listen to them!

00:19:43.790 --> 00:19:45.770
Just you wait, Princess!

00:19:59.230 --> 00:20:02.610
If your business here is complete, please take your leave.

00:20:02.610 --> 00:20:03.350
Not yet.

00:20:15.110 --> 00:20:17.620
The ancient covenant.

00:20:17.620 --> 00:20:20.650
By order of The Three Clans,

00:20:20.650 --> 00:20:23.200
we will hereby perform a purity inspection.

00:21:35.640 --> 00:21:37.950
Dance with the Vampire Maids!

00:21:37.950 --> 00:21:38.940
Part Ten!

00:21:38.940 --> 00:21:40.030
Put some muscle into it!

00:21:40.030 --> 00:21:42.550
You’ll never make yourself useful like that!

00:21:42.550 --> 00:21:43.120
Yes!

00:21:43.120 --> 00:21:45.350
Add a “sir” before and after your answer!

00:21:45.350 --> 00:21:46.450
Sir, yes, sir!

00:21:46.450 --> 00:21:47.740
Now, what are you?

00:21:47.740 --> 00:21:49.190
I’m a glasses-girl!

00:21:49.190 --> 00:21:50.430
Just a glasses-girl?

00:21:50.430 --> 00:21:51.700
A big-boobed glasses-girl!

00:21:51.700 --> 00:21:53.510
How old is your boyfriend?

00:21:53.510 --> 00:21:54.580
How old is he?

00:21:54.580 --> 00:21:55.710
He’s thirteen!

00:21:55.710 --> 00:21:57.270
Say his name.

00:21:57.270 --> 00:21:58.300
Yuzuru-chan…

00:21:58.300 --> 00:21:58.720
Louder!

00:21:58.720 --> 00:22:00.580
We won’t find another one like her for another century.

00:22:00.580 --> 00:22:02.460
The maid troupe will be invincible!
